abstract: "Public, privacy-clean reproducibility supplement containing historical deterministic Phase 1-4 records and a completed fixed-screenshot OCR-rule analysis with aggregate results, provenance, sensitivity checks, and a focused two-author validation protocol. Source-claim validity and final article interpretation remain pending independent image coding and author decision."
